      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是苫小牧市的北港火山！\n我要唱的是，『来吧，苫小牧』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d0658ce704259b778a653375fa379a0ff8c6d440ea8f6e5332074fa29911dde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
